# BuildKit picks up "<dockerfile>.dockerignore" for this specific Dockerfile
# (buildx >= v0.33), so a repo-root build context stays lean without adding a
# global .dockerignore to the monorepo.
#
# NOTE: does NOT exclude `scripts/` (root postinstall: ensure-libicu-symlinks)
# nor `packages/db/drizzle` (copied by build:migrations).
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.turbo
.turbo
.git
.github
.husky
.well-known
data
docs
examples
plugins
deploy
**/__tests__
**/*.test.ts
**/*.spec.ts
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
*.log
.DS_Store
